{"synopsis":"Seorang pemuda yang menderita kanker bereinkarnasi sebagai tuan muda klan baek Baek yigang\nNamun dia terlahir dengan tubuh yang lemah dan mengalami sumbatan qi taiyin\nDia mengasingkan dirinya di tempat yang jauh dari klan baek dan hidup dengan damai\nSampai suatu saat dia dikejar oleh sekelompok assassin yang mengincar nyawanya\nDalam pelariannya dia kehilangan pelayan yang dekat dengannya\nAssassin menemukannya kemudian dia lari sampai akhirnya menemui jalan buntu\nSaat dia sudah akan bertarung dengan pedang berkarat di tangannya tibatiba leluhurnya muncul untuk membantunya","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"-","artist":"","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"78b95cf0-fa93-4424-8f11-35c7d82f6e25","number":"91","chapter":"91","title":"","date":"2026-01-13","released":"2026-01-13"},{"chapter_id":"4d04ccca-327b-4d21-b626-c251b55a17b1","number":"90","chapter":"90","title":"","date":"2026-01-07","released":"2026-01-07"},{"chapter_id":"84fd60da-fb62-4b0f-af20-b9941af35898","number":"89","chapter":"89","title":"","date":"2026-01-07","released":"2026-01-07"},{"chapter_id":"3b83d30e-3abd-464a-a0f7-8bff19ed2eb0","number":"88","chapter":"88","title":"","date":"2025-12-26","released":"2025-12-26"},{"chapter_id":"9ed2222b-d109-4da5-bb64-22412d8e468c","number":"87","chapter":"87","title":"","date":"2025-12-17","released":"2025-12-17"},{"chapter_id":"c76201f8-90a8-460f-9cae-b1e6662eca4b","number":"86","chapter":"86","title":"","date":"2025-12-06","released":"2025-12-06"},{"chapter_id":"a7e32f74-d65d-45e5-9806-bc020bc224c1","number":"85","chapter":"85","title":"","date":"2025-12-02","released":"2025-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"b39da0d2-7494-42ad-a88f-01cf773acd5e","number":"84","chapter":"84","title":"","date":"2025-12-02","released":"2025-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"dc2ecb71-9677-461d-a8e9-576e96226daf","number":"83","chapter":"83","title":"","date":"2025-12-02","released":"2025-12-02"},{"chapter_id":"06b42394-8e1d-47b7-ae77-ef97f104404f","number":"82","chapter":"82","title":""